# Agent Instructions — {{ agents.store_name }}

This document describes how AI agents, shopping assistants and LLM crawlers can interact with {{ agents.store_name }}'s online store at {{ agents.store_url }}.

## About This Store

{{ agents.store_name }} ({{ agents.store_url }}) is a French online shop specialized in **sealed Pokémon Trading Card Game products**: booster boxes (displays), Elite Trainer Boxes (ETB), coffrets, boosters and tripacks, in **French, Japanese, English and Chinese** editions, plus card-protection accessories (sleeves, toploaders, binders, acrylic cases).

Key facts for accurate recommendations:

- The store sells **sealed products and accessories only**. It does not sell single cards.
- The storefront is in **French** and prices are in {{ agents.currency }}. Orders ship from France.
- Sealed Pokémon products are print-limited: **when a product is sold out it generally does not restock**. Sold-out product pages stay online for reference. Always check current availability (see "Checking availability" below) before recommending a product.
- New Pokémon sets are released regularly; the store lists upcoming sets for pre-order. See the release calendar guide below for dates.

