### Checking availability

Product data is available as JSON without authentication:

- Product JSON: `GET /products/{handle}.json` (the `variants[].available` field reflects live stock)
- Collection JSON: `GET /collections/{handle}/products.json`
- Search: `GET /search?q={query}&type=product`
- Sitemap: {{ agents.sitemap_url }}

